OL,3,C'My husband's born here but feels like
OL,4,Che's being pushed out'
OL,6,FA couple in Jersey say they may have
OL,7,Fto move off island due to the rising
OL,8,Fcost of living and a lack of
OL,9,Fappropriate housing.
OL,11,FThey recently had a baby daughter and
OL,12,Fwould love to stay but despite both
OL,13,Fworking full-time, they are struggling
OL,14,Fwith their current living situation.
OL,16,FSpeaking anonymously, the mother told
OL,17,FITV Channel: "We're grateful we've got
OL,18,Fa roof over our head, we can feed her
OL,19,Fand everything like that but we really
OL,20,Fneed a bigger place.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785878312
OL,3,C'My husband's born here but feels like
OL,4,Che's being pushed out'
OL,6,F"We are very lucky that my mother and
OL,7,Ffather-in-law look after her because
OL,8,Fwe would be paying for childcare and
OL,9,Fwe wouldn't be able to afford anything
OL,10,Fover here.
OL,12,F"We're very simple people, all we want
OL,13,Fis a house that can accommodate our
OL,14,Ffamily, have a bit of a garden for her
OL,15,Fand maybe a cat or a dog. We're not
OL,16,Fasking for a lot and we're struggling
OL,17,F- we seem to be fighting a losing
OL,18,Fbattle."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785878312
OL,3,C'My husband's born here but feels like
OL,4,Che's being pushed out'
OL,6,FThe woman has lived in Jersey for 18
OL,7,Fyears, while her husband was born
OL,8,Fthere.
OL,10,FDespite owning their own home, they
OL,11,Fsay it is proving impossible to move
OL,12,Fup the property ladder and she feels
OL,13,Flike she is letting her daughter down.
OL,15,FThe mother adds: "It makes my husband
OL,16,Fvery angry but it makes me really sad.
OL,18,F"My husband's born and bred and he
OL,19,Ffeels like he's being pushed off the
OL,20,Fisland, pushed out of his home and
OL,21,Fit's really upsetting.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785878312
OL,3,C'My husband's born here but feels like
OL,4,Che's being pushed out'
OL,6,F"We want her to grow up here because
OL,7,Fit's such a safe place, it's got good
OL,8,Fschools and we both like Jersey.
OL,10,F"We're both trying to get other jobs
OL,11,Fto earn more money, but everything
OL,12,Fstill keeps on going up and wages
OL,13,Fdon't go up with that."
OL,15,FWhen re-elected as Jersey's Chief
OL,16,FMinister unopposed in June, Senator
OL,17,FLyndon Farnham outlined affordability
OL,18,Fand housing as a key priority.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785878312
OL,3,C'My husband's born here but feels like
OL,4,Che's being pushed out'
OL,6,F"Too many people feel that owning a
OL,7,Fhome remains out of reach," he
OL,8,Fexplained at the time. "Too many young
OL,9,Fislanders question whether they will
OL,10,Fbe able to establish their future here.
OL,12,F"We must continue increasing housing
OL,13,Fsupply, accelerate the delivery of
OL,14,Fapproved developments, and support
OL,15,Finitiatives that help islanders access
OL,16,Fhome ownership."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785878312
OL,3,C'My husband's born here but feels like
OL,4,Che's being pushed out'
OL,6,FIn response to the couple saying they
OL,7,Ffeel "pushed out", Jersey's Treasury
OL,8,FMinister, Senator Alan Maclean, says:
OL,9,F"Of course it's not acceptable, we
OL,10,Fdon't want anybody to be pushed out.
OL,12,F"We do realise that it's a difficult
OL,13,Fplace to live at the moment, as it is
OL,14,Fjust about anywhere in the world.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785878312
OL,3,C'My husband's born here but feels like
OL,4,Che's being pushed out'
OL,6,F"Costs are rising everywhere and we
OL,7,Fmust do what we can to ensure a
OL,8,Fcompetitive economy, we need to build
OL,9,Fit so there are more jobs available
OL,10,Fand better prices. The key is the
OL,11,Feconomy is successful and wages are
OL,12,Frising faster than the costs and
OL,13,Fthat's what we need to get back to.
OL,15,FOn the cost of living, he adds: "The
OL,16,FGovernment takes this extremely
OL,17,Fseriously. It's a problem in Jersey,
OL,18,Fit's a problem in fact across the
OL,19,FWestern world.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/8
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,360,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F359A1785878312
OL,3,C'My husband's born here but feels like
OL,4,Che's being pushed out'
OL,6,F"We're working with community sectors
OL,7,Fand businesses to understand the true
OL,8,Fextent of the problem and measures
OL,9,Fthat will make a definable difference."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G8/8
